msgid "The library this demonstrator exists to exercise. Built from source by <a0>{code0}</a0> with smart-trust-tools' own {code1} (Kotlin 2.0.21 Gradle plugin and its graph); no third-party runtime dependency beyond the Kotlin standard library."
